# Vellorae / Hermes Stack conventions

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/BUILD_STATUS.md` before large changes.

## Architecture

- Multi-agent supervisor + specialist pattern (LangGraph target).
- Workflow: VersionEvaluator → Reasoning → Auto-Debugger → Ghost Scraper → MemoryStore → Deployment.
- Live code lives in `backend/agents/`, `agent_claw/`, `shared/agents/registry.yaml`.

## Bug fixes

Tag before fixing: `[SYN]` `[DEP]` `[LOG]` `[SEC]` `[MEM]`.

## Bleeds (verticals)

Switch via `ACTIVE_BLEED` + `shared/workflows/bleed-manifest.yaml`. Do not hardcode clinic/auto/SaaS copy in Python.

## Base44 (when touching Base44 apps)

- Auth: `loginViaEmailPassword`, `me()` — never `signIn()`.
- Functions: `functions.invoke('name', data)`.
- Entities: `filter`, `get`, `create`, `delete`, `subscribe` — never `find`/`insert`.

## Frontend

Tailwind for customer sites. Static-export default for clinic pilots.

## Scripts

Prefer `scripts/setup_stack.ps1`, `start_minimal.ps1`, `verify_stack.ps1` over desktop chat exports in `docs/reference/`.

## Four projects — do not conflate

1. Dashboard CavernWolf (this repo)
2. Vellorae.org (bleed `vellorae`)
3. LocalRankai.net (OneDrive Grease Monkey tree)
4. MechIQ (auto_repair bleed; not merged yet)

Do not copy 80k+ OneDrive node_modules into this repo.
